Subject: [PATCH] ragfit: admin flag from an OIDC group claim (0002
 oidc-admin-group)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Grants and revokes admin on every login when RAGFIT_OIDC_<PROVIDER>_ADMIN_GROUP is set.
See CHANGES-RAGFIT.md. GPLv3 §10.
